{
    "MinigameName": "The Great FORGE - Carnage in the Armory (V1)",
    "Description": "SHOOTING AT THE DWAVES! As the great gunsmith introduces you to his latest invention, a marvelous gunpowder weapon called \"Boom-Stick\", a quick glance around you and you understand that everyone intends to seize it for the first time. exclusive use of his clan! Quick, grab one of these guns and no mercy!!!\n- You each have 30 life points, your own secure respawn point and you are all equipped with the same weapon;\n- Weapon characteristic: rate of fire 2 seconds, one hit removes 10 HP from the target and earns you 2 points, for each kill 4 bonus points;\n- the arena is divided into 3 circular zones. High outer border, tactical advantage. Intermediate border: 10 points at the entrance then every 15 seconds. Central zone: 5 bonus points at the entrance then every 10 seconds.\n",
